--
Windows build of PCHAT.

The installer puts the app into Program Files and leaves a Desktop shortcut and a Start menu entry behind, both with PCHAT's own icon. It also registers the app in Settings, so it can be uninstalled from there.

The zip is the app folder itself, for anyone who would rather run it without installing. Keep the whole folder: the .exe needs data and the .dll files next to it.
